s in Half Street. There are multitudes of interactions that react to what you've learnt, who you've talked to, and what has happened in your journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAD THE CONVERSATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.poster.avif?t=1758319535\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.webm?t=1758319535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/d366fae0e966d2cb330da51a1818e583.mp4?t=1758319535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a varied cast of characters, and start conversations about the topics you've found or the others you've met along the way. Some conversations will prove to be important to find out what happened last night, others will feed you information that could help you break through the wall someone else has put up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PITCH YOUR THEORIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.poster.avif?t=1758319535\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.webm?t=1758319535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/0ad0ebb71a1796ca1002e14e6b703e19.mp4?t=1758319535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect information and interrogate people, you will have opportunities to start pitching conclusions alongside others, to find what you can all agree on. Select one theory, combine them, or ditch them all- there are loads of conclusions to reach, but not all of them will lead to the truth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN US IN THIS MESSY, STRANGE MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the above mechanics, WHODUNNIT? will feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery with various twists and turns, with dialogue and events that are reactive to Howie's journey</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully original, jazzy and fun soundtrack to immerse you in the investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted environments with animated elements, each of them containing multiple interactions that change and react to your in-game actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish, kinetic menus and screens to enhance your play experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robust save/load system, dialogue history, dialogue line pins, and other quality-of-life tools to seamlessly guide you through the play experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.poster.avif?t=1758319535\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.webm?t=1758319535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/extras/f9fbcab311eed19870ccddbfeef1e528.mp4?t=1758319535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, please wishlist the game here on Steam! This way you will get the latest updates as we gear up for the final release! Thank you!</p>","developers":["Don Attico"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/fa3e9cfd3c2e275dd9daf32dba8ff8b00c8e1f3a/header.jpg?t=1758319535","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"WHODUNNIT?","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11+ compatible<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Don Attico"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nDrogas l\u00edcitas","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851280/bc556798728e49e65c19ae92871c881702e6845a/ss_bc556798728e49e65c19ae92871c881702e6845a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758319535","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam